# NOTICE — Making Things Godot AI stack

This repository (`Tzeke000/CC-experments`) vendors and morphs open-source
components. Product branding: **Making Things** Godot AI integration.

## Primary base

**Godot Editor MCP** (hybridindie/godot-mcp)
- Upstream: https://github.com/hybridindie/godot-mcp
- License: MIT (see `LICENSE` and `godot/addons/godot_mcp/LICENSE`)
- Copyright: Johnny D / John Doh (see upstream LICENSE)
- Role: Python FastMCP server (`mcp_server/`), Godot editor addon
  (`godot/addons/godot_mcp/`), skills, tests, docs

### Making Things morphs (non-exhaustive)

- Bridge auth **required by default** (auto-mint token file); see
  `mcp_server/config.py` (`GODOT_MCP_BRIDGE_TOKEN`,
  `GODOT_MCP_ALLOW_INSECURE_BRIDGE`, `~/.config/making-things-godot/bridge.token`)
- Runtime live property write: `godot_runtime_set_live_property` /
  `cmd_set_runtime_property` (decision G — runtime-only, honesty fields)
- Vendored Blender→Godot pipelines under `third_party/`
- Fixture assets and .NET / C# support docs under `fixtures/` and `docs/`
- Product README / UPSTREAM provenance for this fork

